      "y": 40,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 620,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "### \ud83c\udff7\ufe0f Run Overview & Resumption Lineage\n- **Model Name**: **v1.0 \u2014 Baseline 8-Channel Single-Deploy**\n- **Architecture**: `v1.0` (8 Spatial Channels)\n- **Status**: **SUPERSEDED**\n- **Total Training Episodes**: **`30,102`** (Cumulative)\n- **Peak Record**: **`100%` (3\u2605)** (Return: `+101.75`)\n- **Latest Checkpoint**: `trained_models/attacker_ep30102_100pct_3star.pt`\n\n#### \ud83d\udd04 Resumed Training Sessions (6 Total)\n| Session | Episode Range | Delta | Peak Result |\n| :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| **Session #1** | `0 -> 2,400` | `+2,400 ep` | `86% (2\u2605)` |\n| **Session #2** | `2,400 -> 3,824` | `+1,424 ep` | `86% (2\u2605)` |\n| **Session #3** | `3,824 -> 6,514` | `+2,690 ep` | `87% (2\u2605)` |\n| **Session #4** | `6,514 -> 10,208` | `+3,694 ep` | `97% (2\u2605)` |\n| **Session #5** | `10,208 -> 15,216` | `+5,008 ep` | `97% (2\u2605)` |\n| **Session #6** | `15,216 -> 30,102` | `+14,886 ep` | `100% (3\u2605)` |\n\n> **Resumption Rule**: When training resumes from this model, its card automatically updates with cumulative episodes (**30,102**) and re-evaluates the latest weights across all matchups."
    },
