    {
      "id": "v1_baseline_8ch-hyperparams",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1630,
      "y": 2870,
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 560,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### \u2699\ufe0f Hyperparameters & Training Configuration\n\n| Parameter | Configured Value | Tactical Function in PPO |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| **Total Cumulative Episodes** | **`30,102`** | Total combat experience across **6** resumed sessions |\n| **Learning Rate (`lr`)** | `0.0003` | Adam optimizer step size with linear/cosine warmup |\n| **Batch Episodes** | `4` | Number of combat episodes accumulated per PPO policy update |\n| **Minibatch Size** | `64` | Mini-batch sample size for SGD gradient steps |\n| **PPO Epochs (`K`)** | `4` | Number of optimization epochs over each rollout buffer |\n| **Simulation Ticks / Step** | `8` | Combat granularity: `8 ticks` = `0.64s` per agent decision |\n| **Discount Factor ($\\gamma$)** | `0.99` | Long-term return horizon weighting |\n| **GAE Parameter ($\\lambda$)** | `0.95` | Bias-variance tradeoff in advantage estimation |\n| **PPO Clipping ($\\epsilon$)** | `0.2` | Surrogate policy clipping threshold |\n| **Entropy Coefficient** | `0.015` | Exploration incentive preventing early deployment collapse |\n| **Matchup Sampling Mode** | `random` | Sampling distribution across reference compositions and base layouts |"
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-diagnostics-summary",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3560,
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 760,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### \ud83e\ude7a Dual-LLM AI Training Diagnostics & PPO Pathology Fixes (`v2.0 -> v2.1`)\n\nFull Dossier: [[experiments/AI_Diagnostics_And_Training_Fixes|AI Training Diagnostics, Telemetry Architecture & PPO Pathology Fixes]]\n\n- **Diagnostic Engines**: **Argon 4 \u2022 OpenCode** (`google-vertex/gemini-4-argon#medium`) & **Flash 3.8 \u2022 AGY** (`gemini-3.8-flash-medium`).\n- **4 Pathologies Diagnosed at Ep 8,770 (`44/100 Plateaued`) & Corrected (`84/100 Progressing`)**:\n  1. **Action Dumping & Zero-NoOp Collapse** (`NoOp 0.11%`, abilities popped at `t=4\u20136.4s`) $\to$ Fixed via Two-Phase Tactical Pacing (`NoOp 15\u201324%`, abilities at `t=6.4\u201323.2s`) & fast-forward discounting.\n  2. **Factorized Head Entropy Imbalance & Interior-Hole Scattering** (`H(tile) 101.6%`, $\\sigma=17.0\\text{t}$) $\to$ Fixed via normalized per-head `reg_entropy`, exterior cardinal perimeter funneling (`not_interior_hole`), and FiLM spatial conditioning (`Top-5 Tile Mass 2.8% -> 24.5%`, $\\sigma=4.3\\text{t}$).\n  3. **1-Star Perimeter Trash-Clearing Local Optimum** (`4.0%` 2\u2605 TH takedowns, `0.0%` 3\u2605 triples) $\to$ Fixed via calibrated 100-pt dense HP + `+14.0` TH18 milestone reward & Town Hall spell-halo protection (`Overgrowth`/`Invisibility` exclusion).\n  4. **Cross-Army Interference & Critic Lag** $\to$ Fixed via stratified `batch_episodes=12` sampling & `2.5x` Critic LR.\n\n| Metric | Pre-Fix (`Ep 8,770`) | Post-Fix Continuation (`Ep 8,938`) | Live `v2.1` Run (`Phase 1 -> 5`) |\n| :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| **Mean Destruction %** | `59.5%` | `63.8%` (Peak `100%`) | `64.2% -> 71.7%` (Peak `100%`) |\n| **2\u2605+ TH18 Takedown Rate** | `4.0%` | **`51.7% \u2013 54.0%`** | `53.9% -> 68.4%` |\n| **3\u2605 Triple Rate** | `0.0%` | **`3.3% \u2013 4.0%`** | `4.0% -> 15.0%` |\n| **Argon 4 Health Verdict** | `PLATEAUED (44/100)` | **`PROGRESSING (84/100)`** | **`PROGRESSING (78/100)`** |"
    },
